        `makeStyles` + `tokens`; three style objects keyed on mount (page/dialog/inline). Variants differ in layout density + chrome, NOT color/typography palette — keeps the theming pipeline intact.
      </pattern>
      <pattern name="Canonical recipient normalization" location="projects/email-communication-solution-r4/reference/r3-send-side-design.md">
        §5.6.1 — one `RecipientField` doing separator parsing + directory resolve + Fluent Tags + regex-on-commit. Replaces the 5 caller-local variants.
